<!--
  Settings cog, drawn to match the bud silhouettes.

  Style rules taken from ic_bud_left/ic_bud_right so the set reads as one family:
  a single filled white path, no strokes, no holes for fine detail, and shape
  carried by outer silhouette rather than internal lines. Filled rather than
  outlined deliberately: the buds are solid fills, so an outlined cog would look
  borrowed from another icon set.

  Teeth are trapezoid-ish stubs on a ring, drawn as one continuous path so the
  vector has no overdraw seams. The centre hole is a real hole (drawn with the
  even-odd fill rule), because a filled disc with a drawn circle on top would not
  match the monotone buds and would disappear against dark backgrounds.
-->
